Here's a step-by-step guide on how to create an OBS QSS theme that incorporates gradients, purple and blue colors, Montserrat Alternates font, and aesthetics inspired by DOS branding.

### Custom OBS QSS Theme

Below is the QSS (Qt Style Sheet) code snippet that you can use to implement this theme in OBS:

```css
/* Global Settings */
* {
    font-family: 'Montserrat Alternates', sans-serif;
    color: #FFFFFF; /* Default text color */
}

/* Main Window */
QMainWindow {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:1, stop:0 #6A5ACD, stop:1 #1E90FF); /* Gradient from purple to blue */
}

/* Title Bar */
QWidget#titleBar {
    background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:1, stop:0 #4B0082, stop:1 #00BFFF); /* Darker gradient */
    border: none;
}

/* Buttons */
QPushButton {
    background-color: #4B0082; /* Dark purple */
    border: 2px solid #00BFFF; /* Blue border */
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 5px 10px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

QPushButton:hover {
    background-color: #6A5ACD; /* Lighter purple on hover */
    border: 2px solid #1E90FF; /* Lighter blue on hover */
}

/* Text Fields */
QLineEdit, QTextEdit {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); /* Semi-transparent white */
    border: 1px solid #00BFFF; /* Blue border */
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 5px;
    color: #FFFFFF; /* Text color */
}

/* Labels */
QLabel {
    color: #FFFFFF; /* White text for labels */
    font-weight: bold;
}

/* Sliders */
QSlider {
    background: #4B0082; /* Dark purple background */
}

QSlider::groove:horizontal {
    background: #1E90FF; /* Blue groove */
    height: 8px;
}

QSlider::handle:horizontal {
    background: #6A5ACD; /* Lighter purple handle */
    border: 2px solid #00BFFF; /* Blue border */
    width: 16px;
    margin-top: -4px;
    margin-bottom: -4px;
}

/* Combo Boxes */
QComboBox {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); /* Semi-transparent white */
    border: 1px solid #00BFFF; /* Blue border */
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 5px;
    color: #FFFFFF; /* Text color */
}

/* Checkboxes */
QCheckBox {
    color: #FFFFFF; /* White text */
}

QCheckBox::indicator {
    background-color: #4B0082; /* Dark purple */
    border: 1px solid #00BFFF; /* Blue border */
}

QCheckBox::indicator:checked {
    background-color: #6A5ACD; /* Lighter purple when checked */
}

/* Scroll Bars */
QScrollBar:vertical {
    background: #4B0082; /* Dark purple */
    width: 10px;
}

QScrollBar::handle:vertical {
    background: #6A5ACD; /* Lighter purple */
    min-height: 20px;
}

QScrollBar::add-line:vertical, QScrollBar::sub-line:vertical {
    background: none; /* No background for arrows */
}

/* Progress Bars */
QProgressBar {
    background-color: #4B0082; /* Dark purple */
    border: 1px solid #00BFFF; /* Blue border */
    border-radius: 5px;
}

QProgressBar::chunk {
    background-color: #1E90FF; /* Blue chunk */
    border-radius: 5px;
}

/* Tooltips */
QToolTip {
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); /* Semi-transparent black */
    color: #FFFFFF; /* White text */
    border: 1px solid #00BFFF; /* Blue border */
    font-family: 'Montserrat Alternates', sans-serif;
}
```

### Implementation Steps

1. **Install Montserrat Alternates Font**: Ensure that the Montserrat Alternates font is installed on your system. You can download it from Google Fonts or other font repositories.

2. **Open OBS**: Launch OBS Studio.

3. **Access Settings**: Go to `Settings` > `General`.

4. **Custom CSS**: Look for the option to add custom QSS or CSS. This may vary based on the version of OBS you are using.

5. **Paste the Code**: Copy the provided QSS code and paste it into the custom CSS section.

6. **Apply Changes**: Save the changes and restart OBS to see the new theme in action.

### Aesthetic Considerations

- The gradient backgrounds create a modern and dynamic look, while the use of purple and blue aligns with the requested color scheme.
- The Montserrat Alternates font adds a contemporary touch, enhancing readability and aesthetics.
- The overall design is inspired by DOS branding, focusing on simplicity and functionality while maintaining a visually appealing interface.

Feel free to adjust colors, padding, and other properties to better suit your preferences!

